# .trivyignore
# List CVE IDs to suppress in Trivy scans.
# Each entry MUST have a comment explaining why it's accepted + a review date.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # reason | accepted by | review by YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-12345  # false positive in base image, no exploit path | eugene | review by 2026-07-01
